s; forecast rests on fundamentals and expert ratings.", "Incumbent Tom Suozzi (D) is running."]}, "overview": "Tom Suozzi seeks a full term in a swingy Long Island district that Donald Trump carried in 2024, facing a rematch against Republican Mike LiPetri. Suozzi enters with a large financial edge, broad local endorsements from police and firefighter unions and the U.S. Chamber, and a centrist record he has emphasized in ads. LiPetri has raised a competitive but smaller sum and leans on attacks tying Suozzi to his party's left wing and his stock-trading record.\n\nOutside groups, including a Trump-affiliated super PAC, have poured millions into attacks, making this one of New York's most-watched House races. Still, expert raters mostly place it at Likely or Solid Democratic, and prediction markets price Suozzi around 88-89 percent. With no public polling available, the forecast leans on fundamentals and ratings, pointing to a clear but not insurmountable Suozzi advantage.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.9133, "margin": 9.07}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.894, "margin": 8.5}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.8981, "margin": 8.5}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.907, "margin": 9.5}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.8709, "margin": 8.5}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.8973, "margin": 9.5}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.8955, "margin": 8.5}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.9136, "margin": 9.0}, {"date": "2026-09-30", "p_dem": 0.9155, "margin": 9.5}, {"date": "2026-10-01", "p_dem": 0.9242, "margin": 9.5}, {"date": "2026-10-02", "p_dem": 0.9213, "margin": 9.5}, {"date": "2026-10-03", "p_dem": 0.9012, "margin": 8.5}, {"date": "2026-10-04", "p_dem": 0.8932, "margin": 8.5}, {"date": "2026-10-05", "p_dem": 0.8983, "margin": 9.5}, {"date": "2026-10-06", "p_dem": 0.9, "margin": 9.5}, {"date": "2026-10-07", "p_dem": 0.8878, "margin": 9.0}, {"date": "2026-10-08", "p_dem": 0.9106, "margin": 9.5}, {"date": "2026-10-09", "p_dem": 0.9007, "margin": 